# --- RAW harvest + CLEAN traceability (contain supplier source URLs / lcsc
#     identifiers; kept OUT of the deployed bundle. Authoritative archive lives
#     at D:/SZ Procure/01_RAW and 02_CLEAN) ---
# ALL of /data/ is a LOCAL build input only (masters, dictionaries, pilot
# reports, RAW/CLEAN traceability — many carry supplier source_url / LCSC
# references forbidden on the live domain). The site is pre-generated static
# and needs none of it at runtime. Keep everything on disk for gen_parts.py;
# never deploy it.
# P1-A (2026-09-09): the externalized taxonomy is a BUILD-TIME config required by
# gen_parts.py on Vercel, so it MUST ship in the deploy bundle. Un-ignore ONLY
# this one file; the rest of data/ stays ignored. (Use data/** — not data/ — so
# the negation below can actually take effect; git cannot re-include a file
# inside an ignored directory.)
data/**
!data/category_taxonomy.json

# --- QA / dry-run / test scratch (NOT part of site) ---
_shots/
_dryrun_audit/
_gen_test_100/
_gen_test_500/
_gen_test_1000/
_gen_test*/
szbuild_verify/

# --- reports / working docs (per project convention: exclude .md from commits) ---
*.md

# --- local asset archive is NOT deployed (parked in D:////SZ Procure\01_RAW\ASSET) ---
assets/parts/

# --- Datasheet / binary assets: NEVER enter git or the Vercel deploy package ---
# PDFs (and other binary datasheets) live in Cloudflare R2 (object storage).
# Only the HTTPS URL is committed (in the generated HTML / master datasheet_url
# column). A second gate in tools/pre_deploy_audit.py blocks any binary from the
# deploy bundle even if someone force-adds with `git add -f`.
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.dat
*.bin
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z

.vercel

# --- Phase 3.1 derived read-only slug map (regenerable from parts.json via
#     _phase3_1_apply_test/derive_slug_map.py; NOT hand-edited, NOT deployed) ---
enrich_slug_map.json

# --- PHASE 1 Incremental Publishing build state (regenerable from products/;
#     NOT hand-edited, NOT deployed, NOT committed) ---
build_manifest.json

# --- 01 采集器 SOCKS5 代理凭据 (本地仅运行用; 绝不进仓库 / 部署包) ---
tools/.lcsc_proxy
